    "text": "KTRE\nwebsite\nLone Star\nHeating up and staying mainly dry through this weekend before scattered showers return next week\nBy Brad Hlozek,\n6 hours agoDEEP EAST TEXAS (KTRE) - It will be mostly clear and calm overnight with lows in the lower 70’s. Thursday will be mostly sunny, hot, and dry with highs in the middle 90’s. Our heat indices, or feels like temperatures, will be over 100 during the peak heating of the afternoon.",
